Bool: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 1 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above

Sum: size 2, align 1, stride 2, tag word at 0, payload at 1, niche none
  .0 at 1: U8
  .1 at 1: U8

Colour: size 4, align 1, stride 4, tag word at 0, payload at 1, niche none
  .0 at 1: U8
  .1 at 2: U8
  .2 at 3: U8
  .3 at 1: U8

Five: size 2, align 1, stride 2, tag word at 0, payload at 1, niche none
  .0 at 1: U8
  .1 at 1: U8
  .2 at 1: U8
  .3 at 1: U8
  .4 at 1: U8

Flags: size 1, align 1, stride 1, scalar of 2 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..3, free 0 below / 252 above
  .0 at 0 bits 0..0 of 1 bytes: Bool
  .1 at 0 bits 1..1 of 1 bytes: Bool

Tagged: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag at bits 2..2, scalar of 3 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..7, free 0 below / 248 above
  .0 at 0 bits 0..1 of 1 bytes: Flags
  .1 at 0 bits 0..1 of 1 bytes: Flags

Wide: size 8, align 4, stride 8, tag word at 0, payload at 4, niche none
  .0 at 4: U32
  .1 at 4: U32

Maybe(Sum): size 3, align 1, stride 3, tag word at 0, payload at 1, niche none
  .0 at 1: Sum
